{"query_id":"M2C1-Q037","query":"费用金额审批和预算超支审批是同一回事吗，应如何同时判断？","category":"finance","query_type":"cross_section","answerable":true,"difficulty":"hard","reference_answer":"不是。单笔费用按低于 5000 元、5000 元及以上且低于 2 万元、2 万元及以上三个层级审批；若同时超预算，还须按不超过或超过 10% 完成相应联合审批。","relevant_clause_ids":["FIN-EXPENSE-BELOW-5K","FIN-EXPENSE-5K-20K","FIN-EXPENSE-20K-PLUS","FIN-OVERBUDGET-UPTO10","FIN-OVERBUDGET-OVER10"],"hard_negative_clause_ids":[],"expected_evidence_count":5,"constraint_tags":["expense-tier","budget-tier","dual-control"]}
{"query_id":"M2C1-Q038","query":"部门报销一笔 2.5 万元的普通采购相关费用，且该科目预计超预算 12%，需要同时完成哪些审批？","category":"finance","query_type":"multi_evidence","answerable":true,"difficulty":"hard","reference_answer":"2.5 万元普通采购低于 5 万元，采购申请由部门经理审批；单笔报销达到 2 万元，由财务负责人审批；预算超支超过 10%，还须财务负责人和总经理联合审批，三类控制不能相互替代。","relevant_clause_ids":["PROC-NORMAL-BELOW-50K","FIN-EXPENSE-20K-PLUS","FIN-OVERBUDGET-OVER10"],"hard_negative_clause_ids":["PROC-NORMAL-50K-200K","FIN-OVERBUDGET-UPTO10"],"expected_evidence_count":3,"constraint_tags":["procurement","expense","25k","overbudget-12-percent","separate-approvals"]}
{"query_id":"M2C1-Q039","query":"国内出差原则上应提前几个工作日申请？","category":"hr","query_type":"single_fact","answerable":true,"difficulty":"easy","reference_answer":"国内出差原则上提前 2 个工作日申请。","relevant_clause_ids":["HR-DOMESTIC-ADVANCE-2D"],"hard_negative_clause_ids":["HR-OVERSEAS-ADVANCE-10D","HR-PERFORMANCE-APPEAL-5D"],"expected_evidence_count":1,"constraint_tags":["domestic-travel","advance-window"]}
{"query_id":"M2C1-Q040","query":"员工紧急国内出差先行出发后，应在什么时间补充审批？","category":"hr","query_type":"multi_constraint","answerable":true,"difficulty":"medium","reference_answer":"应在返回后 1 个工作日内补充审批，并说明紧急原因、行程和费用。","relevant_clause_ids":["HR-DOMESTIC-EMERGENCY"],"hard_negative_clause_ids":["HR-DOMESTIC-ADVANCE-2D","HR-OVERSEAS-ADVANCE-10D"],"expected_evidence_count":1,"constraint_tags":["emergency-domestic-travel","ratification"]}
{"query_id":"M2C1-Q041","query":"国内、海外出差的提前申请期限与紧急国内出差补签期限分别是什么？","category":"hr","query_type":"cross_section","answerable":true,"difficulty":"hard","reference_answer":"国内原则上提前 2 个工作日，海外原则上提前 10 个工作日；紧急国内出差可先行，但返回后 1 个工作日内补充审批。","relevant_clause_ids":["HR-DOMESTIC-ADVANCE-2D","HR-OVERSEAS-ADVANCE-10D","HR-DOMESTIC-EMERGENCY"],"hard_negative_clause_ids":[],"expected_evidence_count":3,"constraint_tags":["domestic-travel","overseas-travel","emergency"]}
{"query_id":"M2C1-Q042","query":"员工携带含 L3 数据的设备海外出差，需要同时满足哪些差旅和安全要求？","category":"hr","query_type":"multi_evidence","answerable":true,"difficulty":"hard","reference_answer":"海外出差原则上提前 10 个工作日申请；设备出境前由信息安全办公室评估最小数据、加密和访问安排，L3 数据访问还需部门负责人和信息安全办公室审批。","relevant_clause_ids":["HR-OVERSEAS-ADVANCE-10D","HR-OVERSEAS-SECURITY","SEC-ACCESS-L3"],"hard_negative_clause_ids":["SEC-ACCESS-L4"],"expected_evidence_count":3,"constraint_tags":["overseas-travel","L3","device-security"]}
{"query_id":"M2C1-Q043","query":"国内出差的住宿每晚最高报销标准是多少？","category":"hr","query_type":"unanswerable","answerable":false,"difficulty":"medium","reference_answer":null,"relevant_clause_ids":[],"hard_negative_clause_ids":["HR-TRAVEL-EXPENSE","HR-DOMESTIC-ADVANCE-2D"],"expected_evidence_count":0,"constraint_tags":["domestic-travel","hotel-cap","unsupported"]}
{"query_id":"M2C1-Q044","query":"普通系统访问日志至少保留多少天？","category":"security_governance","query_type":"single_fact","answerable":true,"difficulty":"easy","reference_answer":"普通系统访问日志至少保留 180 天。","relevant_clause_ids":["SEC-LOG-GENERAL-180D"],"hard_negative_clause_ids":["SEC-LOG-L3L4-365D"],"expected_evidence_count":1,"constraint_tags":["general-log","retention"]}
{"query_id":"M2C1-Q045","query":"L3 数据访问需要哪些审批？","category":"security_governance","query_type":"single_fact","answerable":true,"difficulty":"medium","reference_answer":"需要部门负责人和信息安全办公室审批。","relevant_clause_ids":["SEC-ACCESS-L3"],"hard_negative_clause_ids":["SEC-ACCESS-L4","SEC-DATA-L2","SEC-LOG-GENERAL-180D","SEC-LOG-L3L4-365D"],"expected_evidence_count":1,"constraint_tags":["L3","access-approval"]}
{"query_id":"M2C1-Q046","query":"申请访问 L4 数据时，部门负责人和信息安全办公室批准是否足够？","category":"security_governance","query_type":"multi_constraint","answerable":true,"difficulty":"hard","reference_answer":"不够。L4 数据访问须由信息安全负责人和总经理联合审批。","relevant_clause_ids":["SEC-ACCESS-L4"],"hard_negative_clause_ids":["SEC-ACCESS-L3","SEC-DATA-L2"],"expected_evidence_count":1,"constraint_tags":["L4","joint-approval"]}
{"query_id":"M2C1-Q047","query":"申请访问 L3 数据时，除了取得规定审批，还应如何限制访问范围和期限，L2 规则能否替代？","category":"security_governance","query_type":"multi_constraint","answerable":true,"difficulty":"hard","reference_answer":"L3 访问须由部门负责人和信息安全办公室审批，并遵循最小权限和最短期限；L2 内部数据规则不能替代 L3 审批。","relevant_clause_ids":["SEC-DATA-L3","SEC-ACCESS-L3","SEC-LEAST-PRIVILEGE"],"hard_negative_clause_ids":["SEC-DATA-L2","SEC-ACCESS-L4"],"expected_evidence_count":3,"constraint_tags":["L3","access-approval","least-privilege","access-duration"]}
{"query_id":"M2C1-Q048","query":"L1 到 L4 的含义是什么，实际访问应遵循哪些通用控制原则？","category":"security_governance","query_type":"cross_section","answerable":true,"difficulty":"hard","reference_answer":"L1 为公开、L2 为内部、L3 为机密、L4 为严格受限；实际访问遵循最小权限、最短期限和职责分离。","relevant_clause_ids":["SEC-DATA-L1","SEC-DATA-L2","SEC-DATA-L3","SEC-DATA-L4","SEC-LEAST-PRIVILEGE"],"hard_negative_clause_ids":[],"expected_evidence_count":5,"constraint_tags":["L1","L2","L3","L4","classification","least-privilege"]}
{"query_id":"M2C1-Q049","query":"L3 和 L4 数据访问分别由谁审批，获批后的访问审计记录最低保留多久？","category":"security_governance","query_type":"cross_section","answerable":true,"difficulty":"hard","reference_answer":"L3 访问由部门负责人和信息安全办公室审批，L4 访问由信息安全负责人和总经理联合审批；两类数据的访问审计记录至少保留 365 天。","relevant_clause_ids":["SEC-ACCESS-L3","SEC-ACCESS-L4","SEC-LOG-L3L4-365D"],"hard_negative_clause_ids":["SEC-DATA-L2","SEC-LOG-GENERAL-180D"],"expected_evidence_count":3,"constraint_tags":["L3","L4","access-approval","audit-retention"]}
{"query_id":"M2C1-Q050","query":"第三方供应商为维修设备访问 L3 数据时，需要哪些访问、期限和退出控制？","category":"security_governance","query_type":"multi_evidence","answerable":true,"difficulty":"hard","reference_answer":"须完成合同与安全评估，按 L3 规则取得部门负责人和信息安全办公室审批，仅授予具体范围和最短期限；合作或任务结束后应撤销并验证返还或删除。","relevant_clause_ids":["SEC-THIRD-PARTY","SEC-ACCESS-L3","SEC-ACCESS-REVIEW"],"hard_negative_clause_ids":["SEC-ACCESS-L4"],"expected_evidence_count":3,"constraint_tags":["third-party","L3","access-lifecycle"]}
